  "visual_samples": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "segment": "intro",
      "start": 0.2,
      "end": 10.305079,
      "sample_time": 5.252539499999999,
      "text": "Meet OpsCrew, our expense operations copilot. It helps an operator understand an exception, choose a next step, and keep control of the record.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "861ab1b134385ffe2fc88d455c49fe4b5944878d1624cd89bf143aa193ca8ade"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "segment": "intro",
      "start": 10.705079,
      "end": 18.886031,
      "sample_time": 14.795555,
      "text": "This walkthrough uses synthetic data and a demonstration policy. It shows assistance and case handling, rather than a payment system.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "2c7fec6d429ac783f98fafaa1fa82bf43c5eec734b8fd6e9ce68e2063aa0f4aa"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "segment": "problem",
      "start": 19.32,
      "end": 26.418594000000002,
      "sample_time": 22.869297000000003,
      "text": "An incomplete expense can mean repeated checks and follow-up. An operator needs to know what is missing and why it matters.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "580cf5e91a64c481c826fafc43621f3d49492e16804a85f487a7e0f021043239"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "segment": "problem",
      "start": 26.818594,
      "end": 34.951156,
      "sample_time": 30.884875,
      "text": "OpsCrew brings the facts, policy references, and suggested action into one reviewable workflow, while leaving the decision with a person.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "902d0aca91af24baf8243aef3d1e5319bda28efd24c52ce382516eea09818654"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "segment": "build",
      "start": 35.36,
      "end": 43.019728,
      "sample_time": 39.189864,
      "text": "We started the application in Google AI Studio Build. Our teammate used Antigravity for the Google Cloud deployment work.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "a00b7b1b3a1c0d4b80b7e09cb914b4e1f0cf67de02d210c5e883a7d71470bb99"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "segment": "build",
      "start": 43.419728,
      "end": 54.390522,
      "sample_time": 48.905125,
      "text": "Cloud Run hosts the service. Firebase Authentication identifies the visitor, and Cloud Firestore stores confirmed cases. Gemini is called through the server.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "8916d917cc8bb131aef7d1335d4d3cb4be559322c4a70cae873db823355592d5"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "segment": "build",
      "start": 54.790521999999996,
      "end": 58.749252,
      "sample_time": 56.769887,
      "text": "The model credentials stay on the server, outside the browser bundle.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "9aca7de4e012dc9dc9d9665cafb6d61b4f881e76dc6ffcf109b06bf7837f06cb"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "segment": "intake",
      "start": 59.274466999999994,
      "end": 66.62476199999999,
      "sample_time": 62.949614499999996,
      "text": "First, we start a visitor session and enter a synthetic parking expense: thirty-eight dollars, with a missing receipt.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "20ff8fced669d121b446e11fc55e0d8fbda4d69e0890002d9d782f1dd67edbd0"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "segment": "intake",
      "start": 67.024762,
      "end": 72.645533,
      "sample_time": 69.8351475,
      "text": "These text and form inputs are what the system checks. It does not read receipt images.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "01feabec68407f772ae45e8a357f79ae133081c7a6d27b3ecb32756c9ded8fc5"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "segment": "rolemap",
      "start": 73.16,
      "end": 83.558776,
      "sample_time": 78.359388,
      "text": "The facts stage extracts submitted information. The planner proposes a next action with policy references. A separately prompted reviewer checks that proposal.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "acbe677fa9d69ce5895144795b5233c3a52b3f3f5563a24d237e144d32809cef"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "segment": "rolemap",
      "start": 83.958776,
      "end": 92.78544299999999,
      "sample_time": 88.3721095,
      "text": "These are distinct stages using Gemini, not independent people. Structured validation adds another check before an action can become available.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "6810651e2730be5f65a4d86e53b819c3cb2463a6a298ceaed1ce5477a5c495fd"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "segment": "roles",
      "start": 93.5345805,
      "end": 102.8136285,
      "sample_time": 98.1741045,
      "text": "We now run the analysis. The interface records each processing attempt, its outcome, and its duration, so the operator can inspect what happened.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "720bb65a169b8f2053f0a1dc1d30a3373e2f05bfdd5e6eef458e38fd6d83d8e2"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "segment": "roles",
      "start": 103.2136285,
      "end": 111.4654195,
      "sample_time": 107.339524,
      "text": "The displayed timings describe this example; they are not a service guarantee. All three stages finish successfully in this recording.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "14d02105c83da92e31eaf098648ad0b8b2c9bb2d292748b18ad527fbe86c4d86"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "segment": "decision",
      "start": 112.269388,
      "end": 122.634195,
      "sample_time": 117.45179150000001,
      "text": "The plan identifies the missing receipt and asks for evidence. It does not approve reimbursement. The operator can inspect the explanation and policy references.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "5c48d5ff4f5e2e5c251decfa9031da627e623eb44bdef184fd65869abb7e2329"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "segment": "decision",
      "start": 123.034195,
      "end": 128.730612,
      "sample_time": 125.88240350000001,
      "text": "A draft is available to copy and edit. Copying sends no message and makes no payment.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "c52bfb3c75e58c246df9d67be2e40673420ef3ba5cb423d2ba924c77aeaca05d"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "segment": "control",
      "start": 129.2,
      "end": 137.031429,
      "sample_time": 133.1157145,
      "text": "An AI proposal alone cannot save a case. The operator must review the current plan and explicitly confirm an eligible action.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "b66a7f686e0164860898a1bc412ea7b1423dac3690bc28897dbe1b6ab721f203"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "segment": "control",
      "start": 137.431429,
      "end": 147.187257,
      "sample_time": 142.309343,
      "text": "Version checks protect against confirming an outdated plan. This boundary is important: saving a handling record is different from approving or paying an expense.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "8d0dd080711dac97f42e1258c105baeb203ce34aea2c5b428ab39ba2e76403dc"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "segment": "consent",
      "start": 147.747642,
      "end": 154.78551000000002,
      "sample_time": 151.26657600000001,
      "text": "We prepare confirmation, review the plan, and check consent. The server saves one synthetic case.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "a03da1db351a3484e780a04819ba5014962b2785438d234c6ee09b2fd03a3612"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "segment": "consent",
      "start": 155.18551,
      "end": 160.052358,
      "sample_time": 157.618934,
      "text": "The case contains the expense facts and plan. The receipt is still missing.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "b1ded98dc6d8f68419413dcfbd2376a6e732e336ff157c9c604fb35b0af0deea"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "segment": "readback",
      "start": 161.01805000000002,
      "end": 166.710295,
      "sample_time": 163.8641725,
      "text": "Next, we independently retrieve the saved case through an authenticated server API request.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "2c94943856aafd1763b37362cfef21a2d7a3245d5ed8642c78a688139c205246"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "segment": "readback",
      "start": 167.110295,
      "end": 174.74195,
      "sample_time": 170.92612250000002,
      "text": "The readback and same-visitor history show matching case details. This verifies the example, using synthetic data.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "0cb69a0b6caf42161b765cfa58bb89accf57cb24a1577bee96cd1706982c50bf"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "segment": "limits",
      "start": 175.56,
      "end": 184.724354,
      "sample_time": 180.142177,
      "text": "This is a focused prototype, not a universal finance decision engine. It uses synthetic policy data and does not extract receipt images.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "6ecfe9670132d258043b1e193730a4cd7fc0f1931a400b778ed9cb8cc38e8b26"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "segment": "limits",
      "start": 185.124354,
      "end": 195.775374,
      "sample_time": 190.449864,
      "text": "Model requests can fail or take time. People should inspect the evidence and proposed action. These explanations do not claim guaranteed accuracy or turnaround.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "2cc28f6b218da375e67df1cede752275f74f960c019cd8927b13a73ac856b798"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "segment": "outro",
      "start": 196.2,
      "end": 203.014875,
      "sample_time": 199.6074375,
      "text": "OpsCrew combines structured AI assistance, explicit confirmation, and saved-case verification in one workflow.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "decf299d2899284788e95a5ed08e880b26df0ef4247e4d4a4769b34a3249299e"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "segment": "outro",
      "start": 203.414875,
      "end": 210.402267,
      "sample_time": 206.908571,
      "text": "You can explore the deployed Google Cloud prototype and public source using the links shown here. Thank you for watching.",
      "sample_frame_sha256": "97b69175bf2fb5c537ed27cb228a9070a508322a7207ed0e0cb652678dbd8500"
    }
  ],
